{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b9ada5147cbc971e1c075bf3bea4b04cd6bff0f798c90315a6c2360455bf9d5e", "ja": "貴音、お疲れ様。ブログ読ませてもらったよ。\nすっかりヴァンパイアに成りきれているみたいだな。", "zh": "贵音，辛苦了。我看过你的博客了。看来你已经完全进入吸血鬼的状态了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "764d84ec387a5b7f20494d509ba1c71c8866eb39afc0945799cd735da92676e6", "ja": "はい。それも、この衣装を私に合わせて、\nおーだーめいどで仕立ててくださったおかげかと……。", "zh": "是的。也多亏您按照我的身形，为我量身定制了这套服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "42e759cd7edc3864459f5703f7eef871b4573494126bd80c8babb29b1048e214", "ja": "いつもながら、{$P$}のお気遣いには\n真、感謝しております。", "zh": "一直以来承蒙{$P$}关照，\n我由衷地感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5ee1c70afd8d638885ab59cd09852270f432c080de669dd1dd57482f9589ba3c", "ja": "もともとの貴音の魅力を引き出すためだよ。\nでも……、本当に似合ってるなぁ。本物みたいだ。", "zh": "这是为了展现出贵音本来的魅力啊。\n不过……真的很适合你呢。简直就像真的一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "8486c3ce1095999109cb49032ce5382da00e2363c9236980949b119b1e24c529", "ja": "ふふっ……実は私も、先ほどから感じていました。\nこの身から漂う、面妖な気配に……。", "zh": "呵呵……其实我从刚才开始也感觉到了。\n从这副身体里散发出的，诡异气息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "ee46138d0d5f03076eb897101818c58b9c5481a608352befa6f36f6d1b33d0fd", "ja": "ばんぱいあの気品に満ちたこの衣装には、\nなにか特別な力が宿っているのかもしれません……。", "zh": "这身充满吸血鬼高贵气质的服装中，说不定寄宿着某种特殊的力量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "c58f288b1c19204f7211859a414fb33761b2a87867a5251af3f4262714ce4ea6", "ja": "{$P$}。\n少し……、そのままで。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n请……暂时保持那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2f70039ac3e42e302b2244030a57c980144bd0892a42430f127913c9455e2b3d", "ja": "え、貴音？　どうして近づいて……？", "zh": "咦，贵音？为什么靠过来了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "6db535938ab243d503d866866f60578d091172cff30f36bac4b1f420b298a332", "ja": "どうか、動かないで……。\nご無礼をお許しください……。", "zh": "请不要动……  \n还请原谅我的无礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1011_p", "source_sha256": "645bafc3904ed88f8fdef153f2c1cf02a436eb749fdd7c815565f2aa99a1a71d", "ja": "いや、急にどうしたんだ？\nまさか……血を！？", "zh": "不，你突然这是怎么了？\n难道是……血！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "5c95ce5dc23079ba73bb530d57964f4a68f42297f1d444b6c10a5cc9a0c46c52", "ja": "これで大丈夫。……突然、失礼いたしました。\n御髪についていた埃が、気になったものですから。", "zh": "这样就没事了……刚才突然失礼了。\n只是注意到您头发上沾了灰尘。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f9e1513953cdc004bdbda55659ad8bc503af5659da40e12f04aa028d1c72f995", "ja": "なんだ、ゴミを取ってくれたのか。ビックリした……。\n役に入れ込みすぎて、噛みつかれるのかと思ったよ。", "zh": "怎么，原来是帮我拿掉了头发上的灰尘啊。吓我一跳……\n你太投入角色了，我还以为自己要被你咬了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "682c5fd99a58d4353c630b2e4cb3068f3241e063c16e1c530020096dc15b31e1", "ja": "噛みつく……。\n私があなた様の、首筋に……？", "zh": "咬……。\n我咬在您的，脖子上……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1015_p", "source_sha256": "42d6e4da10bd740c497fef1515523e942d24b21706b271c9c8dfdd5fbeeb2f8c", "ja": "（……あれ？）", "zh": "（……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "5a33eff1fe41f06666cc33a1f21a52d41dc57824e0809cae0159845b82d6592c", "ja": "そ、そこまでご無礼なことはいたしません。\n……いたしませんが……。", "zh": "我、我不会做出那么无礼的事。\n……虽然不会……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "451f145d37bffd6916ecf1ce166dd035af64fb3db64d3e61d4dd4d4e6e176799", "ja": "この、かすかな胸の高鳴りと、喉の渇き……。\nこれは……もしや、ばんぱいあの渇望……？", "zh": "这份微微加速的心跳，还有喉咙的干渴……  \n难道这就是……吸血鬼的渴望……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_008tak0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_008tak0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6ac0b287e2b48cb5d200f4ab9150049339d8675d804df476f0482e529fafb05b", "ja": "（今の言葉で、役への理解が深まった……らしい。\nそれはいいけど……しばらく夜道には気を付けるか）", "zh": "（刚才那番话，似乎让她对角色的理解更深了……吧。这样倒是挺好的，不过……最近一阵子还是小心点走夜路吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
